<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10914] Web Console: Account email should be unique</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10914</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I found that if user click several times on &quot;Sign up&quot; it will result in several&#160;identical accounts created, but only one is allowed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To fix we need add unique index for &quot;email&quot; field and prepare migration that will remove possible duplicates.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
