                            <comment id="16741801" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 14 Jan 2019 06:51:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16741968" author="anovikov" created="Mon, 14 Jan 2019 11:40:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed. Find bugs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;error when&#160;lastActivity does not exists&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;`log` function&#160; does not&#160;imported&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Cluster, Cache, DomainModel, Igfs, Notebook, Notifications&#160;and&#160;Sessions &#160;does not removed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16742801" author="kuaw26" created="Tue, 15 Jan 2019 06:51:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;How to test:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start Web Console from &lt;b&gt;previous&lt;/b&gt; release. Configure DB to external folder.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Go to &quot;Sign up&quot;, enter all fields for &lt;b&gt;new&lt;/b&gt; user and fast click several times on &quot;Sign up&quot; button.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Go to &quot;Admin panel&quot; screen - you should see several lines with same user.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Shutdown Web Console.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start&#160;Web Console&#160; from branch ignite-10914.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;On backend startup a special migration should found all duplicates and delete all except one. Check backend output for line &quot;Duplicates found: XX&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Go to &quot;Admin panel&quot; screen - you should see that all user emails now unique.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Try to do the same as #2&#160;(fast click on &quot;Sign up&quot;). Now only &lt;b&gt;one&lt;/b&gt; user should be created.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
